# m3_boss: the M2 sweep, plus the wasm test hooks: god mode at 31 (hits are ignored) and warp
# (waves jump to the boss WARNING). Re-pinned for M7: the Heisenbug has 360 HP in three HP
# phases with a 6 s floor each, so the F1 ship that the old warp at 32 brought could not
# break a phase (P1 timed out after 20 s); the warp is at 1700 now, after the sweep has
# powered up in stage 1. Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (the table runs 4x on a thin field,
# the WARNING lasts 3 s): stage 1's waves come sooner, so by 1700 the sweep had collected F2,
# F3, a fork and an A (A3 at the warp, boss at 1881, breaks at 2389 and 2801, clear at 3338).
# Re-pinned for the mode paces (NORMAL: the table hurries, 3 ticks a tick, only on an empty
# field; the fire ramp counts real ticks): the waves come later again, so by 1700 the sweep
# has F2 (852), the cores (1358) and F3 (1534), and crate 4, a fork (dropped 1594), is still
# on screen; it is collected in the WARNING at 1783. WARNING at 1700 (phase 1), the boss
# spawns at 1881 (phase 2, boss id 0, HP phase 0). Its first HP break (2304) cancels the
# bullets (+70) and drops crate 5 (drops 4 -> 5), the A, which the sweep collects at 2468
# (F3 -> A3, weapon 13); the second break (2664) drops crate 6, the RETRY, collected at 2846
# (shield 1). HP out at 3360, death sequence, then "+500" at 3421: stage_clears 1, the stage
# index moves on to stage 2 (INTEGRATION; debug_stage, the loop, stays 0), and its table
# starts at 3541 (phase 0). (Until the catch-up clock: F3 at the warp, boss at 2061, breaks
# at 2484 and 2939, clear at 3662; until M7: warp at 32, clear at 983, debug_stage 1.)
--frames 4000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "1700 debug_warp" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_stage,debug_stage_index,debug_stage_clears,debug_boss_hp,debug_phase,debug_score --at "100 debug_phase == 0" --at "1699 debug_weapon == 3" --at "1699 debug_drops == 4" --at "1700 debug_phase == 1" --at "1782 debug_forks == 0" --at "1783 debug_forks == 1" --at "1880 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "1881 debug_phase == 2" --at "1881 debug_boss_id == 0" --at "2303 debug_boss_phase == 0" --at "2303 debug_drops == 4" --at "2304 debug_boss_phase == 1" --at "2304 debug_drops == 5" --at "2304 debug_bullets == 0" --at "2304 debug_score == 1926" --at "2467 debug_weapon == 3" --at "2468 debug_weapon == 13" --at "2663 debug_boss_phase == 1" --at "2664 debug_boss_phase == 2" --at "2664 debug_drops == 6" --at "2845 debug_shield == 0" --at "2846 debug_shield == 1" --at "3359 debug_boss_hp > 0" --at "3360 debug_boss_hp == 0" --at "3420 debug_stage_clears == 0" --at "3421 debug_stage_clears == 1" --at "3421 debug_stage_index == 1" --at "3540 debug_phase == 3" --at "3541 debug_phase == 0" --expect "debug_stage_clears == 1" --expect "debug_stage_index == 1" --expect "debug_stage == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_score > 500"
